OL,3,GNEWSAWhat is the Garvaghy Road dispute
OL,4,Aall about?
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt reemerged after a court case in
OL,7,Fwhich a ruling by the Parades
OL,8,FCommission - the organisation formed
OL,9,Fduring the Drumcree dispute to decide
OL,10,Fon contentious marches during Northern
OL,11,FIreland's parading season - was
OL,12,Foverturned.
OL,14,FNow the commission, in a change to
OL,15,Ftheir July ruling, has decided to let
OL,16,Fthe Orange Order proceed with a march
OL,17,Fdown the mainly nationalist Garvaghy
OL,18,FRoad this Sunday.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
